]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-10 sm:py-14","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl","children":["$undefined",["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-content prose prose-blue max-w-none","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A good strategy is not rigid. It is adaptable.</p>\n<p>Knowing when to adjust prevents emotional overreaction.</p>\n<h2>Valid reasons to adjust</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>major life changes</li>\n<li>long-term market shifts</li>\n<li>changes in risk tolerance</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What not to adjust</h2>\n<p>Avoid reacting to daily price movement.</p>\n<p>If you want the goal-setting baseline first, read <a href=\"/blog/how-to-set-realistic-crypto-investment-goals\">How to Set Realistic Crypto Investment Goals</a>.</p>\n<h2>Final thoughts</h2>\n<p>Adjustments should be intentional, not impulsive.</p>\n<p>Next, see how professionals approach risk in <a href=\"/blog/how-professionals-think-about-risk\">How Professionals Think About Risk</a>.</p>\n<p>Prefer strategies built for stability and clarity?\n<a href=\"/plans\">Explore WolvCapital's disciplined approach.</a></p>\n<p>Learn more about WolvCapital on the homepage.\n<a href=\"/\">Visit WolvCapital.</a></p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-disclaimer mt-4","aria-label":"Risk disclaimer","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-disclaimer__card rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Risk disclosure: Digital assets and cryptocurrency-related products can be volatile. You may lose some or all of your invested capital. Consider your circumstances and only invest what you can afford to lose."}]}]}],"$L5"]}]]}]}]]}],["$L6"],"$L7"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
